; Print the name phrase at HL
;
; Points IY at the name phrase (three word codes: noun, then up to two
; adjectives) and has #R$9ED6 print it, then restores IY. Used by the message
; control codes 0 and 9 for a phrase address kept in a record.
;
; HL Address of the name phrase (6 bytes, noun first)
@label=PrintPhraseAtHL
c$7434 PUSH IY       ;
 $7436 PUSH HL       ;
 $7437 POP IY        ;
 $7439 CALL $9ED6    ; prints adjectives, then the noun
 $743C POP IY        ;
 $743E RET           ;
